# esploro.list — Esploro (the feature esploro), Vid's file explorer in
# Common Lisp. It's built from source by vikix esploro setup, with SBCL and
# Quicklisp from the base; these make its previews of the one file selected.
ImageMagick         # pictures: a thumbnail (magick)
poppler             # PDFs: the first page (pdftoppm)
ffmpegthumbnailer   # videos: a frame
